(text "GESTURE RX rev A - schematic reconstructed from Gerber copper/drill/silkscreen.\nNets: VBAT_RAW = XT60 + to switch; VBAT_SW = switch out to TB1+, C3+, Arduino VIN; GND = pour on bottom layer.\nDriver header J3: G, D1=D4, P1=D5, P2=D6, D2=D7. All other Arduino pins unconnected." (at 40 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "12cf8391-f78f-4763-a3ba-53d7a5e4e9f6"))
